    "long_instructions": "##Prototype Lesson 7 - Co-Campaign Manager\r\n####Part 1 \r\n\r\nStudents use an AI as a Campaign Manager to generate materials for a mock student council race, seeing how it can quickly brainstorm diverse ideas.\r\n\r\n####Possible Student Input\r\n\r\n**Core Values** - List 3-5 values they want their campaign to stand for\r\n\r\n**Target Audience** - List specific groups within the school they want to include\r\n\r\n**Platform** - Identify a real school issue\r\n\r\n**Visual Style** - Describe the \"vibe\" and color palette\r\n\r\n**Constraints** - Define what the AI cannot do\r\n\r\n####Possible AI Outputs\r\n**Slogans**\r\n\r\n**Events**\r\n\r\n**Policies**\r\n\r\n**Campaign Poster**\r\n\r\n",
